<![CDATA[<span id="docs-internal-guid-c27095c1-d770-7356-aad2-c03ce3aa5c3e" style="font-size: 15.4545450210571px; line-height: 15.6818180084229px; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font face="Georgia"><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">Good afternoon {!Contact.FirstName},</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">Thank you for registering for tonight’s information session. &nbsp;This session will be covering the [<b>Masters without Arizona teacher certification programs</b>], including complete program details and admissions information.&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">This is an online information session, and takes place today, [<b>Tuesday, September 16th, from 5:30pm-7:30pm</b>]. Please take the time to log in for this event using the following link: (<b>enter link to adobe room here</b>). The room will be open at 4:50pm to give you time to log in. &nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">I look forward to having you join the session. &nbsp;If you have any questions or concerns please feel free to contact me!</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">Kindest regards,</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><br></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">Donna Parris &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">Student Outreach Coordinator &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><font color="#990000"><b>Arizona State University </b></font>| <font color="#ffcc33"><b>Mary Lou Fulton Teachers College &nbsp; </b>&nbsp; &nbsp;</font> &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">	</span><span style="font-size: 15.4545450210571px; line-height: 15.6818180084229px;">donna.parris@asu.edu &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">480.727.1745 &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p></font></span>]]></td>
